---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/footer.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import IntroVideo from "../components/intro-video.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Icon School of Excellence | Best School in Electronic City, Bangalore"
  description="Icon School of Excellence, located in Electronic City, Bangalore, offers world-class education with state-of-the-art facilities, focusing on nurturing academic excellence and overall development."
  keywords="Icon School of Excellence, best school in Electronic City, schools in Bangalore, top schools in Electronic City Bangalore, CBSE schools in Electronic City, holistic education, schools near me, quality education Bangalore"
  og_title="Icon School of Excellence | Leading School in Electronic City, Bangalore"
  og_description="Discover Icon School of Excellence, a premier educational institution in Electronic City, Bangalore. We provide exceptional academic programs and extracurricular opportunities to shape future leaders."
  og_image="/logo.png"
  og_url="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com"
  twitter_description="Explore Icon School of Excellence in Electronic City, Bangalore – a hub for quality education and overall student development."
  twitter_image="/logo.png"
  robots="index, follow"
  canonical="https://iconschoolofexcellence.com"
>
  <body>
    <!-- ------popup------- -->

    <div id="popup-banner" class="popup-banner hidden">
      <div class="popup-content">
        <button id="close-btn-popup" class="close-btn-popup">&times;</button>
        <img
          src="assets/images/icon-1001.jpg.jpeg"
          alt="Popup Banner"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ------popup------- -->

    <Header />
    <div class="page-wrapper">
      <main class="main-wrapper">
        <Hero />

        <!-- <IntroVideo /> -->

        <header class="section_header82">
          <div class="header82_component">
            <div class="padding-global">
              <div class="container-large">
                <div class="padding-vertical padding-large">
                  <div class="w-layout-grid home_showreel_content-wrapper">
                    <div
                      blocks-name="header14_content-left"
                      blocks-slot-children="ST232"
                      class="home_showreel_content-left"
                    >
                      <div class="w-richtext">
                        <blockquote class="block-quote brown">
                          “Creating a dynamic learning environment where
                          leadership, autonomy, multiculturalism and the pursuit
                          of knowledge converge.”
                        </blockquote>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                      blocks-name="header14_content-right"
                      blocks-slot-children="ST232"
                      class="home_showreel_content-right"
                    >
                      <p blocks-name="paragraph" class="text-size-medium">
                        At ICON School of Excellence, we promise that your child
                        will not only receive top notch education but also
                        develop the skills and confidence necessary to navigate
                        the future. With this exceptional team guiding them,
                        students are empowered to embark on a transformative
                        journey towards a successful and fulfilling life.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </header>

        <article id="prospectus" class="section_home_prospectus-and-flyer">
          <div class="padding-global">
            <div class="container-large">
              <div class="padding-section-medium">
                <div class="w-layout-grid home_prospectus-and-flyer_component">
                  <div
                    id="w-node-eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9c6-e424d249"
                    class="layout423_row"
                  >
                    <div
                      data-w-id="eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9c7"
                      class="layout423_card w-inline-block"
                    >
                      <div
                        id="w-node-eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9c8-e424d249"
                        class="layout423_image-wrapper"
                      >
                        <div
                          data-w-id="eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9c9"
                          class="layout423_overlay"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <img
                          src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/learn-live.webp?updatedAt=1745912073075"
                          loading="lazy"
                          decoding="async"
                          sizes="(max-width: 991px) 90vw, 43vw"
                          alt="icon-school-of-excellence-students-learning-to-live"
                          class="layout423_image"
                        />
                      </div>
                      <div class="layout423_card-content">
                        <div class="margin-bottom margin-medium">
                          <div
                            class="text-weight-semibold text-color-primary text-color-white"
                          >
                            Appreciate Life!
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <h3
                          blocks-name="heading-3"
                          class="text-color-white light-text"
                        >
                          Learn to Live
                        </h3>
                        <div
                          data-w-id="eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9d1"
                          class="layout423_card-content-bottom"
                        >
                          <div class="margin-top margin-small">
                            <img
                              src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/home/Learn-to-Live.png?updatedAt=1745912098306"
                              loading="lazy"
                              decoding="async"
                              width="113"
                              sizes="(max-width: 479px) 38vw, 112.99715423583984px"
                              alt="icon-school-of-excellence-learn-to-live-icon"
                              class="imagesize"
                            />
                            <p class="text-color-white-2">
                              <br />‍<strong class="bold-text light-text"
                                >At our school, we nurture every learner to
                                embrace life with curiosity and confidence. We
                                believe that learning is more than just
                                academics—it's about developing essential life
                                skills. By fostering critical thinking,
                                emotional intelligence, and a growth mindset, we
                                prepare our students to navigate challenges and
                                seize opportunities in a dynamic world. Every
                                learner is encouraged to live authentically,
                                embrace diversity, and contribute meaningfully
                                to society.

                                <br />‍</strong
                              >
                            </p>
                            <div
                              class="text-weight-semibold text-color-primary text-color-white description"
                            >
                              • Happiness, Mindfulness, Perseverance
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div
                      data-w-id="eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9f1"
                      class="layout423_card w-inline-block"
                    >
                      <div
                        id="w-node-eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9f2-e424d249"
                        class="layout423_image-wrapper"
                      >
                        <div
                          data-w-id="eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9f3"
                          class="layout423_overlay"
                        >
                        </div>
                        <img
                          src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/sharingcaring.webp?updatedAt=1745912076598"
                          loading="lazy"
                          decoding="async"
                          sizes="(max-width: 991px) 90vw, 43vw"
                          alt="icon-school-of-excellence-students-having-fun"
                          class="layout423_image"
                        />
                      </div>
                      <div class="layout423_card-content">
                        <div class="margin-bottom margin-medium">
                          <div
                            class="text-weight-semibold text-color-primary text-color-white"
                          >
                            Sharing &amp; Caring
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <h3
                          blocks-name="heading-3"
                          class="text-color-white light-text"
                        >
                          Building Connections
                        </h3>
                        <div
                          data-w-id="eaf7b58e-08e1-62ae-5ab1-ff3e3392d9fb"
                          class="layout423_card-content-bottom"
                        >
                          <div class="margin-top margin-small">
                            <img
                              src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/home/building-connections.png?updatedAt=1745912096807"
                              loading="lazy"
                              decoding="async"
                              width="113"
                              sizes="(max-width: 479px) 38vw, 112.99715423583984px"
                              alt="icon-school-of-excellence-building-connections-icon"
                              class="imagesize"
                            />
                            <p class="text-color-white-2">
                              <br />‍<strong class="bold-text light-text">
                                Compassion and empathy are at the heart of our
                                community. We instill in our learners the value
                                of sharing, not only in material terms but also
                                in knowledge, kindness, and support. By
                                fostering a culture of caring, we help students
                                build lasting relationships and understand the
                                importance of collaboration and mutual respect.
                                At our school, sharing and caring form the
                                foundation for a harmonious and inclusive
                                environment, where every individual is valued.

                                <br />‍</strong
                              >
                            </p>
                            <div
                              class="text-weight-semibold text-color-primary text-color-white description"
                            >
                              • Respect, Empathy, Gratitude
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <section class="life-at-isoe">
          <h2>Why Choose ICON School of Excellence?</h2>
          <div class="lifeat-container">
            <div class="life-at-list">
              <h3>Trained and Dedicated Teachers</h3>
              <h6 class="subititle">68 Experienced Teachers</h6>

              <div class="para">
                <p>
                  Our team of trained and qualified educators employs the VARK
                  teaching methodology, embracing a multisensory approach to
                  learning. This allows us to tailor the educational experience
                  to meet the unique learning styles of each student, ensuring
                  that every child thrives in the classroom.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="life-at-list">
              <div>
                <h3>Comprehensive Extensive Resources</h3>
                <h6 class="subititle">More than 3,600 Library Books</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="para">
                <p>
                  We offer a well-stocked library that serves as an invaluable
                  resource, enhancing our curriculum with a wide range of
                  reference materials to support and enrich student learning.
                  The library is a quiet haven where students can immerse
                  themselves in books, research, and exploration.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="life-at-list">
              <div>
                <h3>Extremely Innovative Learning Spaces</h3>
                <h6 class="subititle">58 Smart Classrooms</h6>
              </div>

              <div class="para">
                <p>
                  We will make every learner flourish as a being, find their
                  passion, develop identity and character, resilience, and
                  happiness. We believe that personal well-being and a strong
                  character is the basis for thriving in a rapidly changing
                  world. **By nurturing these qualities, we prepare students not
                  only for academic success but for a balanced and fulfilling
                  life.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="evoltion-container">
            <div class="evolution-text-section">
              <h2>Admissions at ICON School of Excellence</h2>
              <div>
                <p>Enroll Today at ICON School of Excellence</p><br />

                <p>
                  At ICON School of Excellence, we are committed towards
                  cultivating the leaders of tomorrow through a comprehensive
                  educational approach. Our dedicated team of qualified
                  educators and exceptional facilities foster a nurturing
                  environment for each child to develop an environment of
                  excellence. We emphasize the development of not only academic
                  abilities but also emotional strength, physical fitness, and a
                  robust sense of community.
                </p><br />

                <p>
                  Classes for the upcoming academic year will commence in the
                  first week of June. We warmly invite you to visit us to
                  discover more about our vision and programs.
                </p><br />

                <p>
                  Embark on this exciting journey of holistic growth and
                  exploration of your child with us!
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evoltion-image-section">
              <img
                src="assets/images/admission open.webp"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

