              <div class="item">
                <h3>Co-Scholastic Learning & Life Skills</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
                  <h2>Co-Scholastic Learning & Life Skills</h2>
                  <p>
                    We emphasize the importance of co-scholastic activities and
                    life skills, preparing students for success beyond academics
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="item">
                <h3>Educational Field Trips</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
