                  <p>
                    We prioritize student well-being with an exclusive sick room
                    for any type of health emergencies
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="item">
                <h3>In-House Psychologists</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
                  <h2>In-House Psychologists</h2>
                  <p>
                    We offer the support of in-house psychologists to cater to
                    the emotional and mental well-being of our students.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="item">
                <h3>Workshops for Community</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
                  <h2>Workshops for Community</h2>
                  <p>
                    We conduct workshops for students, parents, and faculty to
                    foster collaboration and continuous learning
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="item">
                <h3>Techno-Functional Curriculum</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
                  <h2>Techno-Functional Curriculum</h2>
                  <p>
                    We strive to provide a curriculum that integrates technology
                    and practical skills, preparing students for the future
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="item">
                <h3>Multi-Sensory Learning for Kindergarten Students</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
                  <h2>Multi-Sensory Learning for Kindergarten Students</h2>
                  <p>
                    Our multi-sensory approach in early education ensures a rich
                    and engaging learning experience for young children.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="item">
                <h3>Supportive Parent Enrichment Programmes</h3>
                <div class="background-img"></div>
                <div class="overlay">
                  <h2>Supportive Parent Enrichment Programmes</h2>
                  <p>
                    We organize programmes for parents to enhance their
                    involvement in their child's education
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="evoltion-container">
            <div class="evoltion-text-section">
              <h2>School Awards</h2>
              <div>
                <p>
                  Accredited as one of the premier schools in Electronic City,
                  ICON School of Excellence proudly celebrates its students'
                  achievements. Our students have actively participated in
                  various national-level competitions, earning numerous
                  accolades in Olympiads and talent search contests, among
                  others. These accomplishments reflect our commitment to
                  fostering excellence and encouraging our students to reach
                  their fullest potential.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evoltion-image-section-top">
              <img
                src="assets/images/awards.webp"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <div class="evoltion-container-acc">
            <div class="evoltion-image-section-top">
              <img
                src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/about/evolution.webp?updatedAt=1745912254112"
                alt="icon-school-of-excellence-our-evoluation"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="evoltion-text-section">
              <h2>Accreditations</h2>
              <div>
                <p>
                  ICON School of Excellence is accredited by the Council for the
                  Indian Secondary Certificate Examination, covering Grades I to
                  X. Our curriculum is thoughtfully designed to accommodate
                  students of diverse abilities and global career aspirations,
                  ensuring a seamless transition from year to year. This
                  approach equips students to tackle the challenges of their
                  coursework and prepares them for university life ahead.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

